res around every corner! In addition, DarkEnd also features flexible skill trees that allow you to shape your hero to your liking and tactical needs!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as you please</h2>There are 4 difficulties which will allow you to either fully experience the game or simply blitz through. Do not like grinding for EXP? Turn on the &quot;Milestone Leveling System&quot; and your heroes will level up automatically as the story advances.The choice is yours!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High Replay Value</h2>The story unfolds according to your choice of heroes! Replay with different characters in New Game+ to fully discover the truth behind the DarkEnd.",
